Wed Nov 18 14:30:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.7: MeteoAlarm weather warnings on the weather card
  (weatherAlerts.js, lib/alerts.js): up to two bands in the level's
  colour for warnings in force or due within a day, with the national
  service's own words, its name and the time of issue, and a
  notification once for orange and red. The whole country's feed is
  fetched and the zone found on this computer (alertZones.js, run as
  its own gjs process; only the zone codes are kept). Every 10 minutes,
  not while locked, and on a metered connection only after the person
  agrees. New keys weather-alerts, alerts-metered and alert-zones.
  Words not in the person's language are translated by Gloxi on this
  computer (gloxid text.translate) and shown above the unchanged
  original; words already in that language are shown as they are.

